 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xp7hFMcUkv8Q7kNvwGDqse4&_nc_oc=AdpGzSAHxlQKIE2ZtXCzVE4lydhKgNoE3Oba7M0rvhDkIX89tr1KkWGADlkUlMOP1bg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE_XIJBy_2p2zXcgz0o3WJDrKLEOI8vjNkw1PFe3sc89g&oe=6A941181"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oIZ7aUDEtTQQ7kNvwHmRy8o&_nc_oc=AdrL4DKRcAcw3Xk_nbEZPbl7JvanOtItG_zM4Jib6AstORb_tVrYzcP5-pi_iwmQNeQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHvLE4pds2UVqdF3TOCIe0aj0jYWchxEGnnjtAqz2nQ_Q&oe=6A941EE6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-PLKSlCnXtYQ7kNvwFhFf-A&_nc_oc=AdqYjlDqkXgLqzolMMmb8Cq3mAaMuHRpiNuhZSM4Q0gQxGsMEr0D3Fw_kG2cDoQGa-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE2f6y_FmOwfP6bkLkhRdpgBY1-oqnDHE4SowEGXX6jhA&oe=6A9428DC"}, {"fil